OL,3,AFirst minister demands 'new deal' for
OL,4,AWales before Plaid Cymru conference
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirst Minister Rhun ap Iorwerth has
OL,7,Fwritten to the prime minister to
OL,8,Frequest "a new deal for Wales" before
OL,9,Fhis first Plaid Cymru conference speech
OL,10,Fsince taking office.
OL,12,FIn his letter to Andy Burnham, sent on
OL,13,FThursday and seen by BBC Wales, the
OL,14,FPlaid leader called for more powers to
OL,15,Fbe transferred to Cardiff.
OL,17,FBurnham previously said he would "give
OL,18,Fa fair hearing" to anything put to him
OL,19,Fby the Welsh first minister.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
